#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2317
msgid "Sends any queued changes to the API right after you close this settings window, instead of waiting for the next scheduled or manual sync. This only pushes -- it doesn't also pull a fresh copy of the list from the API."
msgstr "关闭此设置窗口后立即将所有排队的更改发送到 API，而不等待下一次计划或手动同步。这只是推送——不会同时从 API 拉取最新的列表。"

#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2353
msgid "Enable multi-sync (BETA)"
msgstr "启用多方同步（测试版）"

#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2359
msgid "BETA: Sync will now multi-sync across every configured provider by default, reconciling them with your local list instead of just uploading/downloading one account. Turn this off to fall back to the classic single-account sync."
msgstr "测试版：同步现在会默认与所有已配置的提供方进行多方同步，将它们与本地列表进行协调，而不仅仅是上传/下载单个账户。关闭此项可回退到传统的单账户同步。"

#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2369
msgid "Always review changes before syncing"
msgstr "同步前始终检查更改"

#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2375
msgid "Sync fetches every provider and works out what would change per each field's sync rule, then always opens the sync window so you can review and sync it yourself. Turn this off to let Sync carry out clean changes headlessly -- decisions and new-entry adds still always stop for review either way."
msgstr "同步会获取每个提供方并根据各字段的同步规则计算出会发生的更改，然后始终打开同步窗口供你查看并自行同步。关闭此项可让同步以无人值守方式执行简单更改——但需要判断的更改和新增条目仍始终会停下来等待你查看。"

#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2385
msgid "Edit owned scores in the owner's rating system"
msgstr "使用所有者的评分系统编辑其所拥有的评分"

#: hakubun/ui/gtk/data/settingswindow.ui:2391
msgid "When a show's Score is owned by another tracker, let the sidebar score editor rate it in that owner's own system (e.g. AniList's 8.4 while signed into Kitsu), toggled live via the Synced/Platform switch by the slider. Turn this off to always edit in the signed-in account's own system."
msgstr "当作品的评分由其他追踪器所有时，允许侧边栏评分编辑器以所有者自己的系统进行评分（例如登录 Kitsu 时使用 AniList 的 8.4 分），通过滑块上的 同步/平台 开关实时切换。关闭此项将始终在已登录账户自己的系统中编辑。"

